  <!-- SCOPE -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>What do you install and what do I arrange?</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">This is the question most quotes leave vague. Here is the straight answer so you can compare us properly against anyone else.</p>

      <div class="pf-who-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">&#10003;</span><div><strong>We do the strip out</strong><p>The old suite, the old panels and the old pipework come out and go with us. No skip sat on your street waiting for a permit.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">&#10003;</span><div><strong>We do all the plumbing</strong><p>Supply and waste pipework for the bath, shower, toilet and basin. Run properly and clipped, not left loose under the floor. All by our own Gas Safe engineers.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">&#10003;</span><div><strong>We fit the wall panels</strong><p>Waterproof panels to the wet areas and the walls you want covered. No grout lines and nothing to reseal in two years.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">&#10003;</span><div><strong>We supply and fit the suite</strong><p>Bath, shower enclosure, toilet, basin, vanity, taps and valves. Fitted, sealed and tested. If you would rather buy your own we will quote labour only.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-no"><span class="pf-who-icon">&#10007;</span><div><strong>You arrange the floor</strong><p>Floor tiles, vinyl or LVT are down to you. We leave the floor clean and ready. Most customers book their floor fitter for the day after we finish.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-no"><span class="pf-who-icon">&#10007;</span><div><strong>You arrange any tiling</strong><p>We are not tilers. We fit panels instead. If you want tiled walls you book your own tiler and we work around them at first fix.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-no"><span class="pf-who-icon">&#10007;</span><div><strong>You arrange decorating</strong><p>Plastering above the panel line and any painting is not in our price. We will tell you at the survey if your walls need making good first.</p></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="scope-note">
        <strong>Why we say this up front</strong>
        <p>A quote that includes tiling and flooring will look higher than ours. That does not always make it worse value. Ask every fitter you speak to what is excluded, then compare the totals. We would rather you did that than find out halfway through a job.</p>
